From: atvcaptain <openatv@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/ac4: retain the Librempeg decoder

Keep the existing ffmpeg-ext decoder and its FFmpeg 6.1 compatibility
helpers. The skyjet18 branch registers AC-4 but contains a different
decoder implementation. Registration and kbdwin changes are upstream.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [retain the existing decoder implementation]

